  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Admin Screens**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the website\'s admin screens. I\'m starting with the \"Admin\" view, as I have been told to begin there, which has sub-tabs for things like \"Industry Type,\" \"Sensor (active),\" and \"Protocol.\" I\'m planning to hotlink images for now. The images from the provided screenshots are acting as my initial guide.\n\n\n**Designing Admin Interface**\n\nI\'ve sketched out the initial \"Admin\" view, focusing on sensor management. It will include a searchable table, filterable by industry type, with \"+ Add Sensor\" functionality. The table will display industry type, sensor name, timestamps, and action icons. Pagination and a help button are planned. The ThingsAlive branding, navigation, version number, and top header elements are also mapped. I\'ve switched to \"Equipment Management\" screen for inspiration for another section.\n\n\n**Defining Equipment Management**\n\nI\'m now deep in defining the \"Equipment\" section of the sidebar, with focus on details. The top bar will feature equipment searches, status and onboard status filters, and an \"Add Equipment\" button. My plan is to display equipment ID, name, description, category, and maintenance plant. Additional details will include the CCL number, manufacturer, model number, license plate, and engine, all neatly presented in a sortable table. I have example data to use.\n\n\n**Analyzing Tool Mapping**\n\nI\'ve moved on to the \"Tool Mapping\" subtab, with the \"Map Sensors to Tool Configuration\" modal open. It shows sensor association with tooling profiles for industrial telemetry. The modal includes a tool name input, industry type dropdown, protocol radio buttons, and sensor selection checkboxes with channel mappings. Now, I have the exact HTML source provided! I\'m now examining the full HTML for Tool Mapping, and an \"Add New Equipment Setup\" modal.\n\n\n**Developing Device Management**\n\nI\'m now diving into the \"Add Category\" modal and category grid, inspired by Image 7.png. I\'ve got the HTML for the \"ThingsAlive - Admin Equipment Category Form\" and am focused on the \"Add Equipment Category\" modal with its specific details like powertrain specifications and category status. Also, I\'m analyzing the Device Information and Tool Mapping from Image 9.png, especially the \"Mapping Sensor Tool Selection\" dropdown and auto-mapped sensors. Further, I\'m examining Image 11.png, and have mapped the \"Device Management\" view. I\'m noting the metric cards, search and filter options, the \"Add Device\" button, and the details in the table, all the way down to example rows.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 4
      nanos: 361121599
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
