  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Interactive Modals**\n\nI\'m now focusing on developing interactive modals. The initial step involves creating `AddSensorModal.tsx`, which will enable adding new sensors with details like Industry Type, Sensor Name, Code, Protocol, Description, and Parameters.\n\n\n**Designing Sensor Mapping**\n\nI\'ve been working on the `MapSensorsModal.tsx` component, ensuring it aligns with the HTML examples. I\'ve integrated inputs for tool name/model, target industry, and default telematics protocol. There\'s also a selection area for sensors with checkboxes and a live counter for sensor/parameter count. Finally, a \"Save Mapping Profile\" button will be included. I\'m also planning the `AddCategoryModal.tsx` with inputs for category name, code, plant selection, maintenance interval and powertrain specifications.\n\n\n"
