  user_input {
    user_response: "Apply the \"Artistic Flair\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Artistic Flair\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\'h-[768px] w-[1024px] bg-[#FDFCF5] text-[#121212] flex flex-col font-serif overflow-hidden relative\'>\\n  <style>\\n    @import url(\'https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,700;1,700&family=Inter:wght@400;600&display=swap\');\\n    .font-serif { font-family: \'Playfair Display\', serif; }\\n    .font-sans { font-family: \'Inter\', sans-serif; }\\n    .vertical-text { writing-mode: vertical-rl; transform: rotate(180deg); }\\n    .border-ink { border-color: #121212; }\\n    .bg-accent { background-color: #FF4D00; }\\n    .text-accent { color: #FF4D00; }\\n  </style>\\n\\n  <!-- Top Navigation Bar -->\\n  <nav class=\'h-[80px] w-full border-b border-ink flex items-center justify-between px-10 z-20\'>\\n    <div class=\'flex items-center gap-8\'>\\n      <span class=\'text-2xl font-bold tracking-tighter uppercase\'>Chronicle/Studio</span>\\n      <div class=\'h-4 w-[1px] bg-ink/30\'></div>\\n      <span class=\'font-sans text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] opacity-60\'>Digital Portfolio 2024</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\'flex gap-12 font-sans text-[12px] uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold\'>\\n      <a href=\'#\' class=\'hover:text-accent\'>Work</a>\\n      <a href=\'#\' class=\'hover:text-accent\'>Agency</a>\\n      <a href=\'#\' class=\'hover:text-accent\'>Archive</a>\\n      <a href=\'#\' class=\'hover:text-accent underline underline-offset-8\'>Contact</a>\\n    </div>\\n  </nav>\\n\\n  <div class=\'flex-grow flex\'>\\n    <!-- Left Branding Rail -->\\n    <div class=\'w-[80px] border-r border-ink flex flex-col justify-between py-10 items-center\'>\\n      <div class=\'vertical-text font-sans text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] font-bold opacity-40\'>Scroll Down</div>\\n      <div class=\'w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-accent\'></div>\\n      <div class=\'vertical-text font-sans text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] font-bold opacity-40\'>Next Case Study</div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- Main Content Area -->\\n    <main class=\'flex-grow grid grid-cols-12 h-full\'>\\n      <!-- Large Hero Title Section -->\\n      <div class=\'col-span-7 border-r border-ink p-12 flex flex-col justify-end relative overflow-hidden\'>\\n        <div class=\'absolute top-[-50px] right-[-30px] opacity-[0.03] select-none\'>\\n          <span class=\'text-[400px] leading-none font-bold\'>01</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\'mb-8\'>\\n          <span class=\'font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-accent font-bold block mb-4\'>Case Study: Vol. 12</span>\\n          <h1 class=\'text-[100px] leading-[0.9] font-bold italic tracking-tighter\'>\\n            Spatial<br/>Redesign\\n          </h1>\\n        </div>\\n        <p class=\'font-sans text-lg max-w-md leading-relaxed opacity-80\'>\\n          An exploration of minimal interfaces within architectural visualization frameworks. Blurring the line between physical space and digital UI.\\n        </p>\\n        <div class=\'mt-12 flex gap-4\'>\\n          <div class=\'h-[50px] w-[200px] bg-ink text-[#FDFCF5] font-sans flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-bold hover:bg-accent transition-colors cursor-pointer\'>\\n            View Screens\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\'h-[50px] w-[50px] border border-ink flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-ink hover:text-white transition-all cursor-pointer\'>\\n            &rarr;\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <!-- Right Visual Grid Section -->\\n      <div class=\'col-span-5 flex flex-col\'>\\n        <!-- Top Visual Card -->\\n        <div class=\'h-1/2 border-b border-ink p-8 flex flex-col\'>\\n          <div class=\'flex justify-between items-start mb-6\'>\\n            <span class=\'font-sans text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest font-bold opacity-50\'>Visual Archetype</span>\\n            <span class=\'font-sans text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest font-bold\'>[ 01/04 ]</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\'flex-grow bg-[#EAE7E0] border border-ink flex items-center justify-center relative group\'>\\n             <div class=\'w-full h-full bg-gradient-to-br from-white/10 to-transparent absolute inset-0\'></div>\\n             <div class=\'z-10 text-center p-6\'>\\n               <div class=\'w-32 h-20 border border-ink mb-4 mx-auto bg-white/40 backdrop-blur-sm\'></div>\\n               <span class=\'font-sans text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] opacity-40 italic\'>Dynamic Layout 01A</span>\\n             </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        \\n        <!-- Bottom Visual Card -->\\n        <div class=\'h-1/2 p-8 flex flex-col\'>\\n          <div class=\'flex justify-between items-start mb-6\'>\\n            <span class=\'font-sans text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest font-bold opacity-50\'>Interface Sample</span>\\n            <span class=\'font-sans text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest font-bold\'>[ 02/04 ]</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\'flex-grow bg-accent p-[1px]\'>\\n            <div class=\'w-full h-full bg-[#FDFCF5] flex flex-col items-center justify-center border border-ink\'>\\n              <div class=\'w-full px-6 flex flex-col gap-3\'>\\n                <div class=\'h-1 w-1/2 bg-ink opacity-20\'></div>\\n                <div class=\'h-1 w-full bg-ink\'></div>\\n                <div class=\'h-1 w-3/4 bg-ink\'></div>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class=\'mt-8 flex gap-2\'>\\n                <div class=\'w-8 h-8 rounded-full border border-ink flex items-center justify-center text-[10px]\'>+</div>\\n                <div class=\'w-8 h-8 rounded-full border border-ink flex items-center justify-center text-[10px]\'>-</div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </main>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <!-- Footer Bar -->\\n  <footer class=\'h-[60px] w-full border-t border-ink flex items-center justify-between px-10 font-sans text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-bold\'>\\n    <div class=\'flex gap-10\'>\\n      <span class=\'opacity-50\'>Location: London, UK</span>\\n      <span class=\'opacity-50\'>Time: 12:44 GMT</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\'flex gap-10 items-center\'>\\n      <div class=\'flex items-center gap-2\'>\\n        <div class=\'w-2 h-2 bg-green-500 rounded-full\'></div>\\n        <span>Status: Available for Work</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <span class=\'text-accent\'>&copy; 2024</span>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML above. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic. You MUST execute file editing or creation tool calls (such as edit_file, multi_edit_file, or create_file) to apply styling updates to target files directly. Do NOT output code blocks, HTML, or TSX directly in your text chat response.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Artistic Flair\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Artistic Flair\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\'h-[768px] w-[1024px] bg-[#FDFCF5] text-[#121212] flex flex-col font-serif overflow-hidden relative\'>\\n  <style>\\n    @import url(\'https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,700;1,700&family=Inter:wght@400;600&display=swap\');\\n    .font-serif { font-family: \'Playfair Display\', serif; }\\n    .font-sans { font-family: \'Inter\', sans-serif; }\\n    .vertical-text { writing-mode: vertical-rl; transform: rotate(180deg); }\\n    .border-ink { border-color: #121212; }\\n    .bg-accent { background-color: #FF4D00; }\\n    .text-accent { color: #FF4D00; }\\n  </style>\\n\\n  <!-- Top Navigation Bar -->\\n  <nav class=\'h-[80px] w-full border-b border-ink flex items-center justify-between px-10 z-20\'>\\n    <div class=\'flex items-center gap-8\'>\\n      <span class=\'text-2xl font-bold tracking-tighter uppercase\'>Chronicle/Studio</span>\\n      <div class=\'h-4 w-[1px] bg-ink/30\'></div>\\n      <span class=\'font-sans text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] opacity-60\'>Digital Portfolio 2024</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\'flex gap-12 font-sans text-[12px] uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold\'>\\n      <a href=\'#\' class=\'hover:text-accent\'>Work</a>\\n      <a href=\'#\' class=\'hover:text-accent\'>Agency</a>\\n      <a href=\'#\' class=\'hover:text-accent\'>Archive</a>\\n      <a href=\'#\' class=\'hover:text-accent underline underline-offset-8\'>Contact</a>\\n    </div>\\n  </nav>\\n\\n  <div class=\'flex-grow flex\'>\\n    <!-- Left Branding Rail -->\\n    <div class=\'w-[80px] border-r border-ink flex flex-col justify-between py-10 items-center\'>\\n      <div class=\'vertical-text font-sans text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] font-bold opacity-40\'>Scroll Down</div>\\n      <div class=\'w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-accent\'></div>\\n      <div class=\'vertical-text font-sans text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] font-bold opacity-40\'>Next Case Study</div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- Main Content Area -->\\n    <main class=\'flex-grow grid grid-cols-12 h-full\'>\\n      <!-- Large Hero Title Section -->\\n      <div class=\'col-span-7 border-r border-ink p-12 flex flex-col justify-end relative overflow-hidden\'>\\n        <div class=\'absolute top-[-50px] right-[-30px] opacity-[0.03] select-none\'>\\n          <span class=\'text-[400px] leading-none font-bold\'>01</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\'mb-8\'>\\n          <span class=\'font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-accent font-bold block mb-4\'>Case Study: Vol. 12</span>\\n          <h1 class=\'text-[100px] leading-[0.9] font-bold italic tracking-tighter\'>\\n            Spatial<br/>Redesign\\n          </h1>\\n        </div>\\n        <p class=\'font-sans text-lg max-w-md leading-relaxed opacity-80\'>\\n          An exploration of minimal interfaces within architectural visualization frameworks. Blurring the line between physical space and digital UI.\\n        </p>\\n        <div class=\'mt-12 flex gap-4\'>\\n          <div class=\'h-[50px] w-[200px] bg-ink text-[#FDFCF5] font-sans flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-bold hover:bg-accent transition-colors cursor-pointer\'>\\n            View Screens\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\'h-[50px] w-[50px] border border-ink flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-ink hover:text-white transition-all cursor-pointer\'>\\n            &rarr;\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <!-- Right Visual Grid Section -->\\n      <div class=\'col-span-5 flex flex-col\'>\\n        <!-- Top Visual Card -->\\n        <div class=\'h-1/2 border-b border-ink p-8 flex flex-col\'>\\n          <div class=\'flex justify-between items-start mb-6\'>\\n            <span class=\'font-sans text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest font-bold opacity-50\'>Visual Archetype</span>\\n            <span class=\'font-sans text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest font-bold\'>[ 01/04 ]</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\'flex-grow bg-[#EAE7E0] border border-ink flex items-center justify-center relative group\'>\\n             <div class=\'w-full h-full bg-gradient-to-br from-white/10 to-transparent absolute inset-0\'></div>\\n             <div class=\'z-10 text-center p-6\'>\\n               <div class=\'w-32 h-20 border border-ink mb-4 mx-auto bg-white/40 backdrop-blur-sm\'></div>\\n               <span class=\'font-sans text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] opacity-40 italic\'>Dynamic Layout 01A</span>\\n             </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        \\n        <!-- Bottom Visual Card -->\\n        <div class=\'h-1/2 p-8 flex flex-col\'>\\n          <div class=\'flex justify-between items-start mb-6\'>\\n            <span class=\'font-sans text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest font-bold opacity-50\'>Interface Sample</span>\\n            <span class=\'font-sans text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest font-bold\'>[ 02/04 ]</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\'flex-grow bg-accent p-[1px]\'>\\n            <div class=\'w-full h-full bg-[#FDFCF5] flex flex-col items-center justify-center border border-ink\'>\\n              <div class=\'w-full px-6 flex flex-col gap-3\'>\\n                <div class=\'h-1 w-1/2 bg-ink opacity-20\'></div>\\n                <div class=\'h-1 w-full bg-ink\'></div>\\n                <div class=\'h-1 w-3/4 bg-ink\'></div>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class=\'mt-8 flex gap-2\'>\\n                <div class=\'w-8 h-8 rounded-full border border-ink flex items-center justify-center text-[10px]\'>+</div>\\n                <div class=\'w-8 h-8 rounded-full border border-ink flex items-center justify-center text-[10px]\'>-</div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </main>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <!-- Footer Bar -->\\n  <footer class=\'h-[60px] w-full border-t border-ink flex items-center justify-between px-10 font-sans text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-bold\'>\\n    <div class=\'flex gap-10\'>\\n      <span class=\'opacity-50\'>Location: London, UK</span>\\n      <span class=\'opacity-50\'>Time: 12:44 GMT</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\'flex gap-10 items-center\'>\\n      <div class=\'flex items-center gap-2\'>\\n        <div class=\'w-2 h-2 bg-green-500 rounded-full\'></div>\\n        <span>Status: Available for Work</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <span class=\'text-accent\'>&copy; 2024</span>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML above. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic. You MUST execute file editing or creation tool calls (such as edit_file, multi_edit_file, or create_file) to apply styling updates to target files directly. Do NOT output code blocks, HTML, or TSX directly in your text chat response.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    }
  }
}
