nding Sensor Parameter Control**\n\nI\'m now integrating manual sensor and parameter selection, even when a tool mapping exists. Users can toggle sensors on/off from the Admin Sensors catalog, directly affecting `activeSensorNames`.  Individual parameters can also be toggled. If a sensor is deactivated, its parameters get cleared. Conversely, when a sensor is manually activated, I\'m setting its parameters to defaults. I\'m also ensuring the UI clearly indicates if a tool mapping match is found.\n\n\n"
