  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Modal Logic**\n\nOkay, here\'s the deal: I\'m focusing on the `AddEquipmentModal.tsx` file. Specifically, when `isOpen` flips to true, I need to reliably initialize category selection, or retain current category, and fill in values for `engineType` and `fuelCapacity`. I also need to figure out how to add an active indicator. I\'m adding `prefilledFromCategory` and `setPrefilledFrom` to the code.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
