ified in `src/components/equipment/AddEquipmentModal.tsx`. Logic handles category selection and auto-populates `engineType` and `fuelCapacity`.\n\n4. Model Knowledge\n- **Architecture & Interfaces:**\n  - `AddEquipmentModal.tsx` handles category selection via `handleCategoryChange`, which updates `engineType` and `fuelCapacity` state based on `categoryItems` (derived from props).\n  - `DeviceSetup.tsx` uses `matchedTool` state derived from `toolMappings` to drive the UI, providing a \"Strict Schema\" vs \"Manual Mode\" experience.\n- **Design System:**\n  - The application uses a specific color palette (Slate for neutrals, Sky for primary actions, Emerald for success/pre-fill, Rose/Amber for warnings/errors).\n- **Data Flow:**\n  - The application uses a central state management approach in `src/App.tsx`, passing core data (`sensors`, `toolMappings`, `categories`, `equipmentList`, `devices`, `plants`) to sub-components.\n\n5. Files and Code\n- **Edited Files**\n  - `/src/components/equipment/AddEquipmentModal.tsx`: Updated styling to match the ThingsAlive design system (colors, borders, buttons, badges). Implemented auto-fill feedback logic and visual indicators.\n  - `/src/components/devices/DeviceSetup.tsx`: Updated styling to match the ThingsAlive design system.\n- **Viewed Files**\n  - `/src/components/admin/AddCategoryModal.tsx`: Inspected category creation fields to ensure consistency with equipment setup.\n  - `/src/components/equipment/EquipmentManagement.tsx`: Inspected table and modal integration.\n  - `/src/App.tsx`: Verified state passing for `categories`, `plants`, and `toolMappings`.\n  - `/src/data/mockData.ts`: Inspected initial mock data structures for categories and sensors.\n\n6. Current Work and Next Steps\n- **Status:** All requested features are implemented.\n- **Next Steps:** The next agent should confirm with the user if they have any additional requirements or if they would like to proceed with testing the current implementation. No further code changes are required at this time."
